<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Iusacell started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Iusacell started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns analysts Rizwan Ali and C.A. Recouso started coverage of Mexican telephone company Grupo Iusacell SA de CV Monday with a rating of attractive.</p>
<p>-- They set a 12-month target price of $21 on the company's American Depositary Receipts (ADRs). They were up 1/16 at 18-3/8 in New York.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
